From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jens Willmer <info@jwillmer.de>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 01:15:04 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 37/40] Fold and unfold from the View menu and the keyboard

Fold (Ctrl+Shift+[) folds the block at the cursor, Unfold (Ctrl+Shift+])
opens it, and Fold all / Unfold all act on the whole file. A folded
header shows a dot marker; the gutter, change marks, tints, whitespace
markers and the current-line highlight skip hidden lines. Cursor motions
step over folds, find and replace reveal a hit inside one, and reload
unfolds everything.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

